    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 7,
        "sourceEnd": 498,
        "text": "Welcome, everyone. My name is Sarah, and I'll be showing you around the new library today. The library was built last year and opened to students in September. As you can see, the building is divided into three main areas: the reading zone, the group study rooms, and the digital lab. First, we'll visit the reading zone, which is on the ground floor. Then we'll go upstairs to the group study rooms. Finally, we'll finish in the digital lab, where you can use computers and print documents.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "8a85db9a1cbdcdbb4585d84277d3d947f92612539486daa103b4c43522cee2d3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "student",
        "speaker": "Student",
        "sourceStart": 508,
        "sourceEnd": 561,
        "text": "Excuse me, is the reading zone only for silent study?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "5879add81779586e9ba7e81a7fbf988aec4f9ec759598825ecdf02861ba5871d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 569,
        "sourceEnd": 827,
        "text": "Good question. The reading zone is mainly for silent study, but there are also some comfortable chairs near the windows where you can read quietly. However, talking is not allowed there. If you need to discuss something, you should use the group study rooms.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "21d061228d2a00b53d9da9f2fd90e16b572351d8f94efb3bbe586146ee029758",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "student",
        "speaker": "Student",
        "sourceStart": 837,
        "sourceEnd": 882,
        "text": "I see. And how do we book a group study room?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "85283fcc4b0dde29f3ae98a31ad6933ce8a8ba0ba3930a28cf981ab3062750ce",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 890,
        "sourceEnd": 1125,
        "text": "Group study rooms can be booked online through the library website. You need your student ID number to log in. Each room can be used for up to two hours at a time. If you want to book for longer, you have to make two separate bookings.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "e9cea073a5b3d24d88e2cfd0c7241081f13a6eb9771aaf611215218a301372c5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "student",
        "speaker": "Student",
        "sourceStart": 1135,
        "sourceEnd": 1180,
        "text": "Are the rooms equipped with anything special?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "2d79d000ef55759bba23082198404ac82928287f991151577a747f6358a6452a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 1188,
        "sourceEnd": 1410,
        "text": "Yes, each room has a large screen and a whiteboard. The screens are connected to the library's computer system, so you can show your work to your group. Also, the rooms are soundproof, which means you won't disturb others.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "9bbb54424013b65facf5b5a40952689eaf85a26b24b8faa087540c36f9af4ae8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "student",
        "speaker": "Student",
        "sourceStart": 1420,
        "sourceEnd": 1466,
        "text": "That sounds great. What about the digital lab?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "97ae58ebdd8d13203a1aa016c344c482bcf61c10be2e4547eb5c3b652394ab94",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 1474,
        "sourceEnd": 1749,
        "text": "The digital lab is on the second floor. It's equipped with 50 computers, all of which have the latest software. Printing services are also available there. You can print up to 100 pages per week for free. If you need more, you can buy extra printing credit at the front desk.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "5188ba295b5a945b94a3fbc73748a3b48af92025f30128bd285e7e11cb4a3903",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "student",
        "speaker": "Student",
        "sourceStart": 1759,
        "sourceEnd": 1804,
        "text": "Can we use the digital lab without a booking?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "a442032f265925846cab47b7808aec06534a875fe18648f31b9b7ad31078f25f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 1812,
        "sourceEnd": 2059,
        "text": "Yes, you can just walk in, but it can get busy during exam periods. It's recommended to check the availability online before you go. Oh, and one more thing: food and drink are not allowed in the library, except in the café area on the first floor.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ef6027a877ceda9344b23e4193554caef50fd5a5926e73c31715a7449a58d203",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "student",
        "speaker": "Student",
        "sourceStart": 2069,
        "sourceEnd": 2142,
        "text": "Thanks for the information. I think I'll use the group study rooms a lot.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "024b1f171d8ddc27c6ec218abbd365bf74c5c32e27920e8deae138b362d009c0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "guide",
        "speaker": "Guide",
        "sourceStart": 2150,
        "sourceEnd": 2253,
        "text": "You're welcome. If you have any more questions, feel free to ask at the front desk. Enjoy your studies!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ef7b3e70ee58beeb21e76b8d6108f261c6a12b963deeaf3546b8801c0023b69b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
